

Rust is installed now. Great!

To get started you need Cargo's bin directory 
(/workspace/verifast-mdnew-fullmake/cargo/bin) in your PATH
environment variable. This has not been done automatically.

To configure your current shell, you need to source
the corresponding env file under /workspace/verifast-mdnew-fullmake/cargo.

This is usually done by running one of the following (note the leading DOT):
. "/workspace/verifast-mdnew-fullmake/cargo/env"            # For 
sh/bash/zsh/ash/dash/pdksh
source "/workspace/verifast-mdnew-fullmake/cargo/env.fish"  # For fish
source $"/workspace/verifast-mdnew-fullmake/cargo/env.nu"  # For nushell
